T1  - Artificial intelligence powering education: ChatGPT's impact on students' academic performance through the lens of technology-to-performance chain theory
AU  - Al-Mamary, Yaser Hasan
AU  - Alfalah, Adel Abdulmohsen
AU  - Shamsuddin, Alina
AU  - Abubakar, Aliyu Alhaji
