T1  - The mediating role of critical thinking between AI literacy and learning burnout in nursing students using generative AI: A cross-sectional descriptive study
AU  - Jiang, Xiuping
AU  - Wei, Qingyan
AU  - Pang, Shiguang
AU  - Liu, Qian
